<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="upgrade-insecure-requests">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="canonical" href="<%= canonical %>">
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;600;800;900&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Local CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
    <link rel="preload" href="/logo.png" as="image">

    <!-- Safari & Apple Specific Meta -->
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/logo.png">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="default">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#000000">

    <!-- Universal Social/Search Cards -->
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="<%= title %>">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="<%= description %>">
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://pdftopractice.in/logo.png">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://pdftopractice.in/logo.png">

    <!-- Favicon & Icons -->
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon.png">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon.png">
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/favicon.png">
</head>
<body class="bg-[#f4f4f0] dark:bg-[#0a0b0e] text-black dark:text-white font-sans min-h-screen pb-16">
    <header class="border-b-[3.5px] border-black bg-white dark:bg-[#0f111a] sticky top-0 z-40">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 h-20 flex items-center justify-between">
            <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 px-5 py-2.5 bg-cyan-400 text-black font-black uppercase text-xs tracking-wider border-[3px] border-black shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_#000] hover:-translate-x-0.5 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_#000] active:translate-x-0 active:translate-y-0 transition-all select-none">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-black shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"></path></svg>
                <span>Back to Home</span>
            </a>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-yellow-400 text-black border-[2px] border-black font-black text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_#000]">Document</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>
    <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 mt-12">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#11131c] border-[3.5px] border-black p-8 md:p-12 shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_#000] dark:shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_#22d3ee] transition-all">
            <!-- Header section -->
            <div class="border-b-[3.5px] border-black pb-6 mb-8 text-left">
                <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-black dark:text-white uppercase tracking-tight leading-none mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
                <p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Last Updated: July 2026</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Content Area -->
            <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-sm md:text-base font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-8 text-left leading-relaxed">
                <p class="text-base font-bold text-black dark:text-white">Welcome to PDF to PRACTICE. Your privacy is critically important to us.</p>
                
                <div>
                    <span class="bg-yellow-400 text-black border-[2.5px] border-black px-4 py-1.5 inline-block font-black uppercase text-xs tracking-wider mb-4 shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_#000]">1. Data Collection</span>
                    <div class="bg-emerald-400 text-black border-[3px] border-black p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_#000] rounded-none my-4">
                        <p class="font-black uppercase text-xs tracking-wider mb-1">Zero Transmissions Policy</p>
                        <p class="font-bold text-sm leading-snug">We DO NOT collect, store, or transmit ANY of your personal data or uploaded files.</p>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-4">This application is entirely client-side. When you upload a PDF (like a DPP or PYQ), the file is processed <strong>locally within your web browser</strong> on your device. We do not have servers that receive your documents, and we do not track your practice scores or history.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div>
                    <span class="bg-yellow-400 text-black border-[2.5px] border-black px-4 py-1.5 inline-block font-black uppercase text-xs tracking-wider mb-4 shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_#000]">2. Local Storage</span>
                    <p>We use your browser's LocalStorage and IndexedDB to save your theme preferences (Light/Dark mode) and your practice history (e.g., bookmarks, recent sessions, notes) so you can resume them later. This data remains on your device and is never sent to us or any third party.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div>
                    <span class="bg-yellow-400 text-black border-[2.5px] border-black px-4 py-1.5 inline-block font-black uppercase text-xs tracking-wider mb-4 shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_#000]">3. Third-Party Services</span>
                    <p>We use third-party CDNs (like Cloudflare and jsDelivr) to serve essential libraries (like PDF.js and Tailwind CSS). These providers may collect basic connection information (like IP addresses) as part of their standard web serving logs.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div>
                    <span class="bg-yellow-400 text-black border-[2.5px] border-black px-4 py-1.5 inline-block font-black uppercase text-xs tracking-wider mb-4 shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_#000]">4. Changes to this Policy</span>
                    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Since we don't collect your email address, we encourage you to review this page periodically.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
